<view class="music-page">
  <view class="brand-row"><view class="brand-icon">♫</view><view class="brand-copy"><text class="brand-name">听见</text><text class="brand-caption">LISTEN & FEEL</text></view><button class="about-button" bindtap="about">关于听见</button></view>
  <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">● EVERYDAY, A NEW SOUND</text><text class="hero-title">把生活，调到
喜欢的频率。</text><text class="hero-description">不必急着出发，先让一首歌陪着你
从汽水音乐出发，遇见今天的好心情</text><button class="hero-action" bindtap="randomPlay" disabled="{{!items.length}}">▶　随心听一首</button><view class="record-decoration"><view class="record-core">听见</view></view><text class="record-caption">33⅓ RPM · SIDE A</text></view>
  <button class="search-entry" hover-class="search-entry-pressed" bindtap="openSearch" aria-label="搜索歌曲，按歌名或歌手查找">
    <view class="search-entry-icon"><view class="search-entry-lens"/></view>
    <view class="search-entry-copy"><text class="search-entry-title">搜索歌曲</text><text class="search-entry-hint">输入歌名、歌手，找到喜欢的旋律</text></view>
    <view class="search-entry-arrow">↗</view>
  </button>
  <view class="section-head"><view><text class="eyebrow">PICK YOUR MOOD</text><text class="section-title">此刻，想听什么 <text class="accent">?</text></text></view><text class="section-note">给日常加一点旋律</text></view>
  <view class="mood-grid"><view wx:for="{{moods}}" wx:key="title" class="mood {{item.tone}}" data-query="{{item.title}}" bindtap="mood"><text class="mood-symbol">{{item.symbol}}</text><text class="mood-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="mood-label">{{item.label}}</text></view></view>
  <scroll-view wx:if="{{featured.length}}" scroll-x="{{true}}" class="featured-scroll" show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="featured-row"><view wx:for="{{featured}}" wx:key="id" class="featured-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="playSong"><view class="featured-cover"><cover-art url="{{item.cover_url}}" title="{{item.title}}"/><text class="featured-number">{{item.number}}</text><view class="featured-play">{{currentId === item.id && playing ? 'Ⅱ' : '▶'}}</view></view><text class="featured-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="muted featured-artist">{{item.artist}}</text></view></view></scroll-view>
  <view class="section-head list-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">FRESH FINDS, JUST FOR YOU</text><text class="section-title">发现好音乐 <text class="count">{{items.length}} 首</text></text></view><button class="outline compact" bindtap="shuffle" disabled="{{loading}}">↻ 换一批</button></view>
  <text class="list-caption">热门关键词推荐 · 仅展示已验证完整版</text>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="retry" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{loading}}">重试</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{refreshing || message || stale}}" class="list-status"><text wx:if="{{refreshing}}" class="status-dot">●</text><text>{{message || (refreshing ? '正在验证可播放歌曲' : '')}}</text><text wx:if="{{stale}}"> · 缓存结果</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-disc">♪</view><text class="empty-title">{{loading || refreshing ? '好音乐正在路上' : '暂未找到可确认完整版的歌曲'}}</text><text class="muted">{{loading || refreshing ? '首次验证需要一点时间，页面会自动更新' : '系统会定期重新检查，不使用试听或虚假歌曲补位'}}</text></view>
  <view class="song-list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="song-row {{currentId === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="playSong"><text class="song-number">{{currentId === item.id && playing ? '♫' : item.number}}</text><view class="song-cover"><cover-art url="{{item.cover_url}}" title="{{item.title}}"/></view><view class="song-detail"><text class="song-name">{{item.title}}</text><text class="song-artist">{{item.artist}}</text><view class="song-extra"><text class="song-album">{{item.album || '—'}}</text><text class="source-tag">{{item.sourceText}}</text></view></view><view class="song-tail"><text>{{item.durationText}}</text><text class="row-play">{{currentId === item.id && playing ? 'Ⅱ' : '▶'}}</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="list-footnote"><text>◷ 播放时实时获取当前音源</text><text>实际音源以播放器显示为准</text></view>
  <view class="footer"><text class="footer-logo">听见　LISTEN & FEEL</text><text>作者：DataShare · 给生活留一点音乐的时间</text><text>仅供个人非商业使用</text></view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{aboutOpen}}" class="modal-mask" bindtap="closeAbout"><view class="about-panel" catchtap="noop"><text class="section-title">关于听见</text><text class="about-description">一个简单的音乐空间，让熟悉的旋律陪伴日常。
仅展示已验证完整版，暂不可用的歌曲将在复检通过后恢复。</text><text class="muted">作者：DataShare · 仅供个人非商业使用
音量请使用手机系统按键调节</text><button class="outline" bindtap="diagnostics">服务检查与播放事件</button><button class="primary" bindtap="closeAbout">继续聆听</button></view></view>
<player-bar/>
